				<title>Form 5118-E: Proposal for Reclassification</title>
				<link>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-13880337/form-5118-e:proposal-for-reclassification</link>
				<description></description>
				<pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2020 21:40:46 +0000</pubDate>
				<wikidot:authorName>deathbygin</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>5229982</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <p>This is my tale expansion for my authored <a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-5118">SCP-5118</a> to provoke some thoughts. Special thanks to 'Savan' in the IRC for exceptional crit. Sorry if I missed something when posting; it's my first time posting a tale.</p> <div class="collapsible-block"> <div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">Spoiler</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none"> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">hide</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-content"> <p>Human reality bender turns self into dog?<br /> Or dog turns human to enjoy human things and turns back into a dog when it's about to be caught?</p> </div> </div> </div> <p>Image from Creative Commons.<br /> <a href="https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/4/49/Happy-afternoon-golden-retriever-yoko_%2824326853815%29.jpg">https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/4/49/Happy-afternoon-golden-retriever-yoko_%2824326853815%29.jpg</a></p> 
				 	]]>
				</content:encoded>							</item>
